WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.863
Type Racer is a typing race for two to eight people, and the computer can race too.

2
00:00:06.563 --> 00:00:14.967
Everyone gets the same passage. When the countdown ends, start typing. Mistakes show up in red, so fix them to keep moving.

3
00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:18.151
Your avatar races along the track as you type.

4
00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:24.546
First across the line gets the most points. Then everyone else has thirty seconds to finish.

5
00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:29.256
Most points after all the rounds wins, and average speed breaks any ties.
